    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        "A cabin around 1100 mm wide and 1400 mm deep with an 800 mm clear door opening. That combination lets a wheelchair enter forward and reverse out without turning, and leaves room for a companion. Anything narrower tends to be usable in theory and frustrating in daily practice."
