      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        "Getting the measurements right is mostly about knowing which figure you’re looking at. Cabin size sells the lift; shaft size, pit, overhead and clear door opening are what the building has to deliver. BG Elevators can help verify these dimensions against the requirements of the selected lift. Confirm each of them against a stamped general arrangement drawing for the exact model, check that shaft figures are clear rather than structural, and measure your site instead of trusting old drawings."
